<h2><a href="/news/20080422.html" class="blue">New Article: Open Source Founders Reflect On Project Milestones</a></h2>
<h3 class="medium_grey">Apr 22, 2008</h3>
<p class="content">
Compute Magazine recently interviewed the founders of Wireshark, Asterisk,
and Mondrian about the major milestones of each project.
<a href="http://computemagazine.com/technology/open-source-founders-reflect-on-project-milestones.html">Check it out</a>!
</p>
</div>
<div class="block">
<h2><a href="/news/20080416.html" class="blue">Announcing Pilot</a></h2>
<h3 class="medium_grey">Apr 16, 2008</h3>
<p class="content">
<a href="http://www.cacetech.com/">CACE Technologies</a>, the primary sponsor
of the Wireshark project, has just released <a href="http://www.cacetech.com/products/pilot.htm?utm_source=Wireshark&amp;utm_medium=cpc&amp;utm_term=pilot&amp;utm_content=pilot&amp;utm_campaign=Wireshark_Product">Pilot</a>,
a network analysis and reporting tool that integrates with Wireshark. Take a look!
<br>
<a href="http://www.cacetech.com/products/pilot.htm?utm_source=Wireshark&amp;utm_medium=cpc&amp;utm_term=pilot&amp;utm_content=pilot&amp;utm_campaign=Wireshark_Product">Pilot home page</a>
<br>
<a href="http://www.cacetech.com/media/0_short_intro/">Pilot in 4 minutes</a>
<br>
<a href="http://www.cacetech.com/documents/CACETECH%20PILOT%20PR41608.pdf">Press release</a>
</p>
</div>
<div class="block">
<h2><a href="/news/20080407.html" class="blue">New Video: TCP Connection Loss</a></h2>
<h3 class="medium_grey">Apr 7, 2008</h3>
<p class="content">
In her latest video in Novell Connection Magazine,
<a href="http://www.wiresharku.com/">Wireshark University's</a> Laura
Chappell <a href="http://www.novell.com/img/flash/play.php?media=http://www.novell.com/recording/videos/connectionmagazine/0308_tcpconloss.flv">shows
how to analyze TCP connection loss</a>.
More videos are listed in <a href="/bibliography.html">our bibliography</a>.
</p>
</div>
